--- a/EN-MaxAngleFrames(89).md
+++ b/EN-MaxAngleFrames(89).md
@@ -34,3 +34,5 @@
 Adjusts how many consecutive steering-request frames are allowed at large steering angles.
-
+
+For Hyundai and Kia torque steering, the controller starts with 89 frames. If a later reading is missing or outside 80–100, it keeps the last valid value and resumes sending its request after the two-frame pause.
+
 - **Higher:** Allows steering requests for more frames at large steering angles.
